NOTE ON DATA

This licence covers the source code only.

The reference datasets under `src/data/` and the source workbook under
`data/source/` reproduce definitions published in two IPBES assessments:

  - IPBES Assessment Report on the Underlying Causes of Biodiversity Loss and
    the Determinants of Transformative Change (Transformative Change Assessment)
  - IPBES Nexus Assessment Report on the Interlinkages among Biodiversity,
    Water, Food and Health

That material remains the property of IPBES and is reproduced here with
attribution for research purposes. Reuse of the definitions is subject to the
terms set by IPBES, not to the MIT licence above.
